'''Dwarves''' (singular, '''Dwarf''') are [[Stupid dwarf trick|"intelligent"]], {{Catlink|Humanoids|humanoid}} [[creature]]s that are the featured [[civilization|race]] of [[fortress mode]].

== Needs ==
As living creatures, dwarves need to drink, eat food, and sleep to survive.

